  "thag16.5:1.1": "Rūpaṃ disvā sati muṭṭhā ",
  "thag16.5:1.2": "piyanimittaṃ manasikaroto; ",
  "thag16.5:1.3": "sārattacitto vedeti ",
  "thag16.5:1.4": "tañ ca ajjhosa tiṭṭhati. ",
  "thag16.5:2.1": "tassa vaḍḍhanti vedanā ",
  "thag16.5:2.2": "anekā rūpasambhavā, ",
  "thag16.5:2.3": "abhijjhā ca vihesā ca ",
  "thag16.5:2.4": "cittam ass' ūpahaññati; ",
  "thag16.5:2.5": "evam ācinato dukkhaṃ ",
  "thag16.5:2.6": "ārā nibbāna vuccati. ",
